SUMMARY:2026 Jesse Owens Track & Field Youth Program - Fall
DESCRIPTION:Join the Randall’s Island Park Alliance and City Parks Foundation for the Jesse Owens Track and Field Youth Program! This free weekly program is available to youth ages 8-16 and enables participants to learn the fundamentals of the sport and stay active. Activities will focus on running techniques for sprints and relays and will introduce other track and field activities like long jump\, hurdles\, and long-distance running.  \nProgram Dates:  Every Saturday \nSpring: 4/11 – 6/20\, no program on 5/23  \nFall:  9/12 – 10/31  \nRegistration is required on LeagueApps with City Parks Foundation.  \nLocation: Thomas Jefferson Park \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/2026-jesse-owens-track-field-youth-program-fall-2/2026-10-03
LOCATION:Thomas Jefferson Park
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/400-x-400-photos-4.png
GEO:40.793886;-73.935355
END:VEVENT
