SUMMARY:Bike Ride to Harvest Festival
DESCRIPTION:Ride to the Harvest Festival at Randall’s Island Park with El Barrio Bikes! Meet up at Maria Sola Community Greenspace in the Bronx and enjoy a scenic ride along the riverfront and through the park\, ending at the Festival!   \nFree Citi Bikes will be provided thanks to our partnership with Citi Bike\, and we can offer a limited number of free helmets. In order to reserve a bike and helmet\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org.  \nThere will be a free Bike Valet provided by Transportation Alternatives so you can safely park your bikes and enjoy the festivities with ease of mind. Citi Bikes will not be included in this valet service\, so if you take a Citi Bike to the festival\, please find the nearest docking station to park\, or ask a RIPA staff member where to dock. You can find the four Citi Bike docks on our interactive map!  \nAfter the festival\, enjoy some time exploring the park’s 9+ miles of cyclist and pedestrian pathways!  \nRegistration required here. \nLocation: Maria Sola Community Greenspace \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation\, or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/bike-ride-to-harvest-festival-3
LOCATION:Thomas Jefferson Park
CATEGORIES:Festival,Fitness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/400-x-400-photos-6.png
GEO:40.793886;-73.935355
END:VEVENT
