SUMMARY:Harvest Festival
DESCRIPTION:Step into autumn at the free Randall’s Island Harvest Festival! Celebrate the end of the growing season with a family-friendly day of outdoor fun. Explore our pumpkin patch\, watch seasonal cooking demonstrations\, enjoy live performances\, get creative with face painting\, and discover nature through hands-on activities with local partners. With crisp air and golden leaves all around\, it’s the perfect way to embrace the season and enjoy the outdoors in the heart of New York City. \nThere will be a free Bike Valet provided by Transportation Alternatives so you can safely park your bikes and enjoy the festivities with ease of mind. \nWith crisp air and golden leaves all around\, it’s the perfect way to embrace the season and enjoy the outdoors in the heart of New York City.  \nSchedule: \n\n12 – 2 PM: Live Music with Gloria Anderson + Friends\n12 – 2 PM: Bubble Dad\n12:30 – 1 PM: Cooking Demo with Chef Evie\n1 – 2 PM: Storytime Stretches\n1:30 – 2 PM: Cooking Demo with Chef Evie\n2 – 3 PM: City That Drinks the Mountain Sky by Arm of the Sea Theatre\n\nLocation: Urban Farm + Fields 62/63  \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/harvest-festival-3
LOCATION:Icahn Stadium
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture,Environmental Education,Festival,Urban Farm
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/400-x-400-photos-3.png
GEO:40.792778;-73.924666
END:VEVENT
