SUMMARY:Halloween Boo Bash
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween park-style at the Randall’s Island Park Alliance’s free\, family-friendly Halloween Boo Bash! Come in costume and celebrate Halloween with themed activities\, crafts\, music\, treats\, and more!  \nWe’ll dance to our favorite music\, both spooky-themed and year-round hits\, enjoy pastries from a local bakery\, hear a Halloween story\, and celebrate fall in our beautiful White Garden. We can’t wait to see your awesome costumes and dance moves!  \nLocation: White Garden \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/boo-bash
LOCATION:The White Garden
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture,Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/400-x-400-photos-13-1.png
GEO:40.783007;-73.926694
END:VEVENT
