SUMMARY:Fire Cider Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make fire cider with herbs and produce grown on the Urban Farm! \nFire cider is an herbal tonic that is used to boost immunity and warm you up during the colder months. We’ll provide all the materials and guide you through the process\, so you can make your own batch to take home and enjoy.  \nLocation: Urban Farm \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/fire-cider-workshop
LOCATION:Urban Farm
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSCF0601-scaled.jpg
GEO:40.783753;-73.925686
END:VEVENT
