SUMMARY:Winter Wreath Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a cozy\, hands-on wreath making workshop! Guided by our staff\, you’ll create your own one-of-a-kind wreath using seasonal greenery\, dried flowers\, and natural materials foraged from the Park’s landscape. All materials and instruction are provided. No experience necessary! \nRegistration is required; opens 2 weeks in advance \nLocation: Icahn Stadium Classroom \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request accommodation\, or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org.
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/winter-wreath-workshop-2
LOCATION:Icahn Stadium
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/400-x-400-photos-27.png
GEO:40.792778;-73.924666
